r28|n|A diary; a journal. ; A publication giving the computed places of the heavenly bodies for each day of the year, with other numerical data, for the use of the astronomer and navigator; an astronomical almanac; as, the "American Ephemeris and Nautical Almanac." ; Any tabular statement of the assigned places of a heavenly body, as a planet or comet, on several successive days. ; A collective name for reviews, magazines, and all kinds of periodical literature.	N:jdw,71,4~jdw,71,4
